=qr\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" class=\"hover:text-gray-300 focus:text-gray-300\"><i class=\"fab fa-instagram\"></i></a></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 md:mt-0 text-sm \">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> M.E ESONANJOR AND COMPANY. All rights reserved.</div></div></div></footer></div></div><script id=\"__NEXT_DATA__\" type=\"application/json\">{\"props\":{\"pageProps\":{\"post\":{\"_id\":\"1b70e9ba-d9b8-445b-872b-90b8ed36d09a\",\"author\":{\"bio\":null,\"image\":null,\"name\":\"Ebuzhafe Annora Ogunsanya\"},\"body\":[{\"_key\":\"8a475690186e\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"9352665a7073\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Introduction\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"a97901fbecac\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"0c5e5fe9d764\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"5a2da9e4ebdd\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"1a79829b590c\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"The Nigerian construction industry has undergone significant transformation in recent years, with technology playing an increasingly pivotal role in reshaping how construction law is practiced, enforced, and understood. As Africa's largest economy continues to develop its infrastructure, the intersection of technology and construction law has become a critical area of focus for industry stakeholders, legal practitioners, and policymakers alike.\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"7310a453d0c4\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"eab844c3d58b\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[],\"text\":\"\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"04bea02bea09\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"a43a04e9c711\",\"_type\":\"span\",\"marks\":[\"strong\"],\"text\":\"Digital Documentation and Contract Management\"}],\"markDefs\":[],\"style\":\"normal\"},{\"_key\":\"9afb8993e86c\",\"_type\":\"block\",\"children\":[{\"_key\":\"198a79ad1456\",\"_type\"